--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/plans/prettier-15553-plan.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 jsonc prints trailing commas as the trailingComma option says, for none, es5 and all (tests/format/json/jsonc/trialing-comma/jsfmt.spec.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 jsonc keeps every object key quoted under each quoteProps value (tests/format/json/jsonc/quote-props/jsfmt.spec.js) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 jsonc prints strings with double quotes even with singleQuote (tests/format/json/jsonc/single-quote/jsfmt.spec.js) [AC-3]
+- [ ] 1.4 A JSON with Comments file such as .swcrc is inferred as jsonc and gets trailing commas (tests/integration/__tests__/with-parser-inference.js) [AC-4]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add the jsonc parser beside json and json5 and list it in the parser option (src/language-json/parser-json.js, src/main/core-options.evaluate.js, src/plugins/builtin-plugins-proxy.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Infer jsonc for the JSON with Comments language (src/language-json/languages.evaluate.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Treat jsonc like json for quoted keys, double-quoted strings, comment attachment and range formatting (src/language-js/print/property.js, src/language-js/utils/index.js, src/utils/print-string.js, src/main/comments/attach.js, src/main/range-util.js)
+- [ ] 2.4 Document the parser and add the changelog entry (docs/options.md, changelog_unreleased/json/15831.md)
